>fight_prog 20~
say 怒吼之雷！消滅眼前與我為敵者！
c 3 'lightning bolt' $n
mpnowait
c 2 'chain lightning' $r
mpnowait
~
>fight_prog 30~
say 雷電啊！聚集於我的掌心吧！
mpecho $I將手中的白色光球朝你們一丟！
c 3 'thunder strike' $n
mpnowait
~
>fight_prog 45~
if rand(50)
	mpoload 1792 40
	say 去吧！時光的石板！
	throw time $r
	mpjunk time
	mpnowait
else
	mpoload 1794 60
	say 去吧！爆裂彈！
	throw bomb $r
	mpnowait
	if rand(10)
		say 特技！亂投！
		mpoload 1794 60
		mpoload 1794 60
		mpoload 1794 60
		mpoload 1794 60
		mpoload 1794 60
		throw bomb $r
		mpnowait
		throw bomb $r
		mpnowait
		throw bomb $r
		mpnowait
		throw bomb $r
		mpnowait
		throw bomb $r
		mpnowait
		mpjunk all.bomb
	endif
endif
~
>fight_prog 60~
say 棲息於此的風之精靈，請助我一臂之力．
say 破滅眼前之敵！
c 'wind screaming' $n
mpnowait
c 'wind screaming' $r
mpnowait
c 'wind screaming' $r
mpnowait
~
