        mpechoaround $n $I聽到$N的腳步聲就立刻振翅飛走了.
        if rand(50)
                mpteleport recall1
                mpmod_qmark self staytime v0 = 0
        else
                mpteleport recall2
                mpmod_qmark self staytime v0 = 0
        endif
 endif
~
