            callout 2 echoaround $n 然後....快速的飛進$N手上的手環裡
            callout 3 echoat $n 你感受到手環傳來了安定的力量.
            callout 3 mod_qmark $n southend_snowqueen_worry v0 = 4
            callout 3 mod_qmark $n southend_quest v2 | 2
        else
